    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jenner sits on California’s Pacific coast, just north of the Russian River’s mouth where ocean meets river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jenner%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "South of town, Goat Rock Beach forms part of the Sonoma Coast State Beach, a popular spot for tide‑pooling.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
